Mimid
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, CLUBS}

$initial
DRAW 5 DEAL {JUSA, CRAEL}
COLUMN 7 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 5 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 0 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 3 FACE_ALL

CRAEL 2 FACE_HALF
CRAEL 2 FACE_ALL
CRAEL 10 FACE_ALL
CRAEL 0 FACE_ALL
CRAEL 2 FACE_ALL
CRAEL 1 FACE_ALL
CRAEL 9 FACE_ALL
CRAEL 0 FACE_ALL

JUSA 3 FACE_HALF
JUSA 9 FACE_HALF
JUSA 2 FACE_HALF

GAIX 10 FACE_LAST
GAIX 0 FACE_LAST
GAIX 3 FACE_LAST
GAIX 3 FACE_LAST
GAIX 0 FACE_ALL
GAIX 6 FACE_ALL
GAIX 6 FACE_ALL
GAIX 5 FACE_ALL
GAIX 5 FACE_ALL
GAIX 6 FACE_ALL

$moves
MOVE CRAEL JUSA
AND
    DEST Size >= 7
    AND
        DEST Rank 1
        SRC Rank K
MOVE {GAIX, JUSA, COLUMN, CRAEL} CRAEL
DEST Suit {DIAMONDS, SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS}
$win
OR
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL CRAEL Empty
        PILE ALL CRAEL Empty
